CV Matcher
CV Matcher is a powerful tool designed to automate and enhance the process of matching CVs (resumes) to job descriptions or specific criteria. Leveraging advanced techniques in data science and machine learning, this project aims to streamline recruitment workflows and provide intelligent recommendations for candidate evaluation.

